  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MOZ FFPI Loan</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">MOZ FFPI l&#xe5;n</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FFPI project support comprises a loan and a grant component. The loan component is for establishment of a revolving fund for on-lending by  FFPI to small entrepreneurs with a viable business projects. The      grant is to finance technical assistance services to FFPI, to support in elaboration of a plan of operation and budget; operating           guidelines for FFPI credit policy and FFPI organigram.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sveriges st&#xf6;d till Fundo de Fomento da Pequena Ind&#xfa;stria (FFPI)       p&#xe5;b&#xf6;rjades 3 juni 1994. Avtalet undertecknades av Styrelsen f&#xf6;r       svenskt n&#xe4;ringslivsbist&#xe5;nd (SwedeCorp) och FFPI. St&#xf6;det omfattade ett l&#xe5;n- och garantidel.</narrative>
  </description>
